# Ping Pong Palace (levels/solo/pingpong.txt), the Giant Steps route: the ducks and the cushion
# hall, the kicker, the islands and the net, the low corridor, then toot every bat up the
# chimney (its toots fill the Giant Steps counter) and Down at the top. Floaty legs up onto
# the gallery: low hops under its cushions, jump and toot over the open pits, onto the duck,
# hops under the cushions again. At the merge, the bank shot: jump and toot into the wall's
# duck, it bats you back up onto the shelf; the high score table, the kicker over the drain,
# under the net, up the duck shaft. Format: src/capture/timeline.rs.
